    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "I never studied mathematics beyond basic arithmetic in school. My vocational diploma focused on practical skills, not abstract math. I find it distant and intimidating, especially compared to subjects like history or literature that connect to real life. I enjoy patterns in nature and music, which I see as more intuitive than equations.",
